% ====================== Summary ======================
% Justified, and at most FOUR rendered lines -- \rsummary writes
% "SUMMARY-LINES: N" to the .log so the budget is verifiable.
\rsection{Summary}
\rsummary{One-to-two-line factual statement assembled from \texttt{profile.summary\_seeds}, weighted toward JD keywords the profile genuinely supports. No fabrication, no AI filler.}

